      "Language": "rus",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "A therapeutic response to clinical application of Helium-Neon laser irradiation in combination with antianginal drugs was evaluated for chronic sufferers with coronary heart disease (CHD). The largest scope of information on the efficacy of the laser therapy has been provided by the parameters of lipid peroxidation. Individually adjusted doses of the irradiation allowed achievement of the best treatment results."},
